  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Live now is a nice update, and I'm glad the game wants us to socialize more. But I find it unnecessary as a minor since most of the events live now shows are for adults, it also gives me another tab I have to shift through in order to get to my friends list. I feel like the old home tab was much more useful because it showed me who was on my friends list that I could join and people who I recently played with. That way I didn't have to go to the social tab a lot!\n\nIf there aren't any plans to disable Live now, do you all think we will some kind of filtering for it. That way i can filter out events that I couldn't attend or events that I am uninterested in",
